## Quick Start

```bash
make setup    # Install dependencies
make run      # Run the application
make test     # Run tests
make lint     # Run linter
```

## Development

```bash
make fmt              # Format code
make test-coverage    # View test coverage
make clean            # Clean build artifacts
```

